# Story page: nm-chrono
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Time Loop
---
The rift stopped letting go of anything.

{name} met itself coming back, again and again, until it could no longer tell which of them was the original, and which was simply early.

'You have been here before,' said the coil. 'You will be here again.' I believe it. I have written this sentence before.
